This project includes derived administrative-boundary data from OpenStreetMap
contributors, obtained through the Nominatim service. The generated source is
`xposed/src/main/java/io/github/timeline_unlocker/xposed/RegionBoundary.java`.
It is used only to decide where this module must not apply its GCJ-02
compensation. The data is available under the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0.

Copyright: OpenStreetMap contributors
License: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/
Attribution: https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

Source relations, fetched by `scripts/generate-region-boundaries.mjs` with a
geometry-simplification threshold of 0.00005 degrees:

- Hong Kong: https://www.openstreetmap.org/relation/20044132
- Macao: https://www.openstreetmap.org/relation/1867188
- Taiwan: https://www.openstreetmap.org/relation/449220

Refreshes must be reviewed before committing because OpenStreetMap data can
change over time.
